node_modules/
build/
*.vst3
*.component
.DS_Store

# Differential test vectors: ~56 MB of float64, and a pure function of the JS
# reference — regenerate with `npm run vectors` rather than committing them.
vectors/
native/build/

# Quality-suite renders: graphs and ~21 MB of audio, regenerate with `npm run quality`
quality-out/

# Tenebrae certification scratch. Probes, diagnostic one-offs and A/B copies of
# the artifact get written next to the thing they are testing — that is the
# point, they need serve.mjs's ROOT and ex-lib's relative import. An underscore
# prefix marks them as this-session-only: a `_fx-*` variant of a probe, a
# `_refute_*` isolation, an `_old<sha>.html` build to A/B against. None of it is
# evidence — the committed probes are — and `_old*.html` alone is 5 MB a copy.
tenebrae/_*.html
tenebrae/certification/harness/probes/_*
